(  This token is an ERC777: transferring to a contract calls that contract back before the transfer) Tj T*
(  returns, resolved through the ERC1820 registry, and the ERC777 send\(\) additionally requires a contract) Tj T*
(  recipient to have registered an implementer. A counterparty that credits on deposit and only clears) Tj T*
(  the credit after paying out can therefore be re-entered by the recipient, paid twice out of one) Tj T*
(  balance, and left unable to pay the next honest depositor. The token is not at fault and is behaving) Tj T*
(  to spec. imBTC was the token in the Lendf.Me drain of 2020-04-19, roughly 25 million dollars in one) Tj T*
(  re-entrancy against exactly this shape, which is why a token whose selector set says ERC777 is worth) Tj T*
